        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Shawl of brocaded silk gauze, Great Briatin, 1860-1870."@en , "Shawl of silk gauze with a grey centre and a black outer border. Between the centre and the border is a silk stripe in aniline purple. At intervals on the centre field are brocaded bunches of fruit in shades of aniline mauve with green and black fruit."@en ;
